{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207140","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1720714001:1":{"text":"喂，笨蛋公主，你刚才差点就露馅了。","source_cn":"喂，笨蛋公主，你刚才差点就露馅了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DDF0B85D5001B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720714002:1":{"text":"我只是不想让她那么辛苦嘛！她都那个样子了，要是再熬夜赶工，万一……万一晕倒了怎么办？","source_cn":"我只是不想让她那么辛苦嘛！她都那个样子了，要是再熬夜赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8C402EA2B23FBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720714003:1":{"text":"而且，我本来就想取消宴会，她却还在那么辛苦地为宴会准备珠宝……","source_cn":"而且，我本来就想取消宴会，她却还在那么辛苦地为宴会准备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BB2045853194A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720714004:1":{"text":"我知道你是好心。但是，佩吉，你知道对于一个手艺人来说，最重要的是什么吗？","source_cn":"我知道你是好心。但是，佩吉，你知道对于一个手艺人来说，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC92879D1A076012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720714005:1":{"text":"是……健康？","source_cn":"是……健康？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB082786D3A8FD546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn